minösen Tragschicht mit einer Binderschicht aufgebaut. Zur Entwässerung des vom Bauvorhaben betroffenen Streckenabschnittes der JohannesKepler-Straße sind insgesamt acht neue Straßenabläufe vorgesehen. Die Straßenabläufe sind bündig mit der OK der Binderschicht einzubauen. Die Bordsteine sowie die Pflasterrinne werden auf die endgültige Deckenhöhe gesetzt. Der bituminöse Deckenausbau in der Johannes-Kepler-Straße erfolgt mit Asphaltbinder und bituminöse Tragdeckschicht. Der Aufbau des Gehweges erfolgt mit Betonpflaster inkl. Bettung auf FFS und STS."},{"field_id":"BT-300-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"#Besonders geeignet für:selbst#"},{"field_id":"BT-36-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":"MONTH","value":3.0},{"field_id":"BT-58-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"code":"no-eu-funds","field_id":"BT-60-Lot","list":"eu-funded","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-63-Lot","list":"permission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-70-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"keine"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-717-Lot","list":"cvd-scope","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-726-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"code":"no","field_id":"BT-736-Lot","list":"reserved-execution","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"required","field_id":"BT-743-Lot","list":"einvoicing","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-751-Lot","list":"tender-guarantee-required","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-761-Lot","list":"required","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-764-Lot","list":"ecatalog-submission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-765-Lot","list":"framework-agreement","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-766-Lot","list":"dps-usage","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-767-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-769-Lot","list":"permiss